# A Man-eating Mite (abyssea 177), the edges: a level 99 Warrior in Xarcabard with The Truth Beckons completed,
# Traverser Stones 2 and 3 (two stones: `>= 1`), 1 maw quest completed (An Ulcerous Uragnite) (GMs), Dawn of Death
# available. The maw: no section (Dawn of Death available): 204. Dawn of Death completed (a GM; `>=` accepted): 58,
# finished on option 1: begun (any option). The title (a GM): the zone-in's 59, its update on option 1: updateEvent(the
# key item for 1 completed: Ivory Abyssite of Fortune); finished: it is given, completed.
lists Xarcabard/Cavernous_Maw/onTrigger Xarcabard/onEventFinish/58 Xarcabard/onEventFinish/204 Xarcabard/onZoneIn/1 Xarcabard/onEventUpdate/59 Xarcabard/onEventFinish/59
char zone=Xarcabard pos=271.5,-9,-70 job=WAR lvl=99
quest Abyssea.AJourneyBegins completed
quest Abyssea.TheTruthBeckons completed
keyitem TraverserStone2
keyitem TraverserStone3
quest Abyssea.AnUlcerousUragnite completed
login
trigger Cavernous_Maw                   # Dawn of Death available: no section: 204
finish                                  # option 0: no warp
quest Abyssea.DawnOfDeath completed     # a GM
trigger Cavernous_Maw                   # Dawn of Death completed, two stones: 58
finish option=1                         # begun (any option)
title ReshephEradicator                 # a GM
rezone open                             # 59, left open
update 59 option=1                      # updateEvent(Ivory Abyssite of Fortune)
finish                                  # Ivory Abyssite of Fortune given; completed
